     "value": "BPOM 2D barcode (QR Code)"
    },
    {
     "label": "Rule",
     "read_at": "2026-11-16",
     "source": {
      "publisher": "Badan Pengawas Obat dan Makanan",
      "url": "https://ttac.pom.go.id/"
     },
     "value": "BPOM Regulation 22 of 2022 on 2D barcodes in drug and food control sets two methods: identification codes come with the electronic marketing permit and need no separate application or reporting, while authentication codes are applied for before production, issued electronically by BPOM and reported on use; codes BPOM issues to the pharmaceutical industry take the form of a QR Code."
    }
